<body>
<div class="cd-page">
<div class="cd-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header class="cd-header"><div class="cd-wrap cd-header-inner">
<a class="cd-brand" href="@Url.Content("~/")"><span class="cd-mark">C/</span><span>CrazyDevs<small>Digital identity / MH Anik</small></span></a>
<nav class="cd-nav" aria-label="Case study navigation"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#capabilities">Capabilities</a><a href="#system">Visual system</a><a class="cd-contact-link" href="#contact">Start a project ↗</a></nav>
</div></header>
<main>
<section class="cd-hero">
<div class="cd-wrap cd-hero-grid">
<div class="cd-hero-content"><div class="cd-eyebrow cd-reveal">MH Anik / Selected visual design</div>
<h1 class="cd-reveal cd-delay-1">Crazy<span>Devs.</span></h1>
<p class="cd-hero-copy cd-reveal cd-delay-2">A technology-focused visual identity and digital presentation for software solutions — shaped around a confident digital character, clear communication, and a modern developer-first aesthetic.</p>
<div class="cd-tags cd-reveal cd-delay-2"><span>Visual Design</span><span>Digital Experience</span><span>Branding</span><span>UI / UX Direction</span></div>
<div class="cd-actions cd-reveal cd-delay-3"><a class="cd-button" href="#overview">Explore the project <span>↘</span></a><a class="cd-text-link" href="#visuals">View the visual <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
<div class="cd-hero-art" aria-label="CrazyDevs featured visual"><div class="cd-art-frame" data-cd-tilt><span class="cd-crosshair a"></span><span class="cd-crosshair b"></span><img src="@coverImage" alt="CrazyDevs visual identity artwork" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="cd-orbit-label">DIGITAL / 01</span></div><div class="cd-float-note"><small>DESIGN DIRECTION</small><strong>Built for bold ideas.</strong></div></div>
</div><div class="cd-wrap cd-hero-bottom"><span>Case study / Visual identity</span><span>Scroll to explore ↓</span></div>
</section>
<section class="cd-stats"><div class="cd-wrap cd-stats-grid">
<div class="cd-stat"><small>Discipline</small><strong>Visual design</strong></div><div class="cd-stat"><small>Focus</small><strong>Technology brand</strong></div><div class="cd-stat"><small>Experience</small><strong>Digital presentation</strong></div><div class="cd-stat"><small>Designer</small><strong>MH Anik</strong></div>
</div></section>
<section class="cd-section" id="overview"><div class="cd-wrap">
<div class="cd-section-head cd-reveal"><div><div class="cd-kicker">01 / Project overview</div><h2>Technology deserves<br />a <em>distinct identity.</em></h2></div><p class="cd-intro">CrazyDevs is presented as a technology-focused visual identity and digital experience for software solutions. The design direction puts clarity, modernity and a confident digital personality at the centre of the brand presentation.</p></div>
<div class="cd-overview"><div class="cd-overview-art cd-reveal"><img src="@coverImage" alt="CrazyDevs brand artwork" loading="lazy" /><span class="cd-image-label">CrazyDevs / Brand visual</span></div>
<div class="cd-copy cd-reveal cd-delay-1"><div class="cd-kicker">The creative challenge</div><h3>Make a software-focused brand feel clear, capable and memorable.</h3><p>Technology brands need to communicate more than technical ability. Their visual language should signal curiosity, precision and momentum while keeping information easy to scan and understand.</p><p>The CrazyDevs case study frames the brand through a digital-first lens: strong typography, disciplined contrast, graphic accents and a flexible visual system that can support web content, product communication and portfolio presentation.</p><blockquote class="cd-quote">“A recognisable digital character, built around clarity and forward motion.”</blockquote></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="cd-section cd-band" id="capabilities"><div class="cd-wrap">
<div class="cd-section-head cd-reveal"><div><div class="cd-kicker">02 / Creative capabilities</div><h2>One identity.<br /><em>Multiple touchpoints.</em></h2></div><p class="cd-intro">The visual direction can extend across the key places where a software-focused brand meets its audience. These are creative areas represented by the case study, not a claim that every touchpoint is already deployed.</p></div>
<div class="cd-capabilities">
<article class="cd-capability cd-reveal"><div class="cd-cap-top"><span class="cd-cap-num">01 / 06</span><span class="cd-cap-icon">✳</span></div><h3>Brand identity</h3><p>A recognisable visual personality with consistent graphic cues and a clear technology-oriented tone.</p></article>
